\textbf{mean iters} & \textbf{$\Delta$ mean} \\
\midrule
D1 & random     & $6.087\times10^{11}$ & 11.03 & 9.63 & --- \\
D1 & k-means++  & $5.574\times10^{11}$ & 9.08  & 7.20 & $-8.4\%$ \\
D2 & random     & $2.825\times10^{4}$  & 2.40  & 17.83 & --- \\
D2 & k-means++  & $2.828\times10^{4}$  & 2.26  & 11.50 & $+0.1\%$ \\
D3 & random     & $8.450\times10^{2}$  & 8.36  & 17.70 & --- \\
D3 & k-means++  & $6.317\times10^{2}$  & 12.94 & 11.00 & $\mathbf{-25.2\%}$ \\
