\texttt{src/run.py}, \texttt{src/figures.py}. Results: \texttt{results/main.csv},
\texttt{sweep.csv}, \texttt{ablation.csv}, \texttt{chosen\_params.json}.
Data: global earthquake catalogue (M$\geq$5.5, 1965--2016) and NYC ride-hailing
pickups (April 2014), both public; Ecoli from the UCI Machine Learning
Repository (Horton \& Nakai, 1996).

